# Auto-generated by Android Studio's Gradle sync (pins the Gradle daemon's
# own JVM, not a compile toolchain). Left machine-local on purpose: as
# committed it would require JDK 25 just to start the daemon, which would
# break both CI workflows since neither installs it. Revisit deliberately
# if/when the project wants to standardize on a newer daemon JVM everywhere.
gradle/gradle-daemon-jvm.properties
